      "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "THE ONE IDEA:  the rules live in one place, twice.\n\n  /lib/workflow (TypeScript)  →  the interface is honest before you click:\n                                  the Approve button is absent when you may not approve.\n\n  0003_functions.sql (PL/pgSQL) →  the rule holds even if the interface is bypassed:\n                                  the database refuses the write.\n\nVerified both ways: browser tests assert the button is hidden,\n17 database checks assert the function raises.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "THE ONE IDEA:  the rules live in one place, twice.\n\n  /lib/workflow (TypeScript)  →  the interface is honest before you click:\n                                  the Approve button is absent when you may not approve.\n\n  0003_functions.sql (PL/pgSQL) →  the rule holds even if the interface is bypassed:\n                                  the database refuses the write.\n\nVerified both ways: browser tests assert the button is hidden,\n17 database checks assert the function raises.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14
    }
  ],
